eapons she  chambers them brings them back to the  body  hits again you know multiple attacks  here against that last person  you know a lot of circular movements the  realism the scenario we'd actually give  this  probably a six out of ten just because  we think lucy was doing great work  just doesn't seem so realistic compared  to her opponents
 

